            "id": 1207236,
            "title": "專家股份策略追蹤｜新秀麗銷售重回正增長獲看好　推介華虹宏力",
            "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">股評人連敬涵於節目中推介新秀麗(1910)，指銷售重回正增長，反映旅行需求改善，加上早前與旅遊品牌併購落地，本季增長確定性強，以及股東回報加碼，機構上調目標價都利好股價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div data-bs-component=\"generic\" class=\"image-block responsive-block\" style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263YIFmnVA1A1795070760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4323.jpg\" title=\"4323.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">連敬涵建議15.3元買入，目標價看17元，止蝕價定於14元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">新秀麗(1910)</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">買入：$15.3</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">目標：$17</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">止蝕：$14</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div data-bs-component=\"generic\" class=\"image-block responsive-block\" style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RyArUIgep61795070810.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4324.jpg\" title=\"4324.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">股評人趙晞文推介華虹宏力(1347)，主要是季績指引勝預期，另外受惠國策，因此對國產晶圓代工需求增加。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div data-bs-component=\"generic\" class=\"image-block responsive-block\" style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202681JfXQI6jW1795070820.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4325.jpg\" title=\"4325.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">趙晞文認為股價回落至81元才買入，目標價看95元，止蝕價在70元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">華虹宏力(1347)</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">買入：$81</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">目標：$95</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">止蝕：$70</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div data-bs-component=\"generic\" class=\"image-block responsive-block\" style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o1DqaGdsi51795070833.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4326.jpg\" title=\"4326.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p>",
